id: GQL-007
ilities: [authenticity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: GraphQL error formatting may leak stack traces
category: graphql
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .py .rb .go .java
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: error
patterns:
  - regex: formatError.*stack|includeStacktraceInErrorResponses
    message: "GraphQL error formatting may leak stack traces to clients"
fix: Sanitize errors in formatError; only return message and code. Never expose stack traces, originalError, or internal details to clients in production.
